        ],
        "parameters": {
          "color": 5,
          "width": 416,
          "height": 644,
          "content": "## Human approval workflow\n\n### How it works\n\nAn employee submits an expense request. The workflow preserves the form fields, checks the manager in Duo, and sends a synchronous Push with safe expense context. The approval gate routes an explicit allow result to the approved path; every other result follows the rejected path.\n\n### Setup\n\nCreate a Duo Auth API credential, replace the placeholder manager username, and test the form with a non-production expense before activation. Replace the outcome nodes with your finance, payroll, notification, or audit action.\n\n### Customization\n\nKeep the manager mapping trusted and keep Push Info concise. Never send receipts, payment card details, credentials, tokens, or other secrets in the authentication request."
        },
        "typeVersion": 1
      },
